SUMMARY:Charleston White LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nCharleston White LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nOne of comedy’s most provocative and fearless voices\, Charleston White\, is bringing his electrifying stand-up show to Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa. Known for his raw honesty\, street-smart humor\, and unapologetic storytelling\, Charleston White delivers a comedy experience unlike any other. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM (Doors open 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK 74135\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Prices: $97 – $176 (General Admission & Premium) \nAbout Charleston White\nCharleston White is a comedian\, activist\, and social media personality who has built a massive following with his unfiltered takes on life\, culture\, and society. Rising from humble beginnings in Fort Worth\, Texas\, White has channeled his life experiences into a powerful comedic voice that resonates with audiences across the country. His viral videos and live performances have earned him millions of fans who appreciate his bold\, no-nonsense approach to comedy and social commentary. \nWhat to Expect\n\nBold\, unfiltered stand-up comedy with real talk and real laughs\nPowerful storytelling rooted in authentic life experiences\nHigh-energy performance that keeps the crowd engaged all night\nThought-provoking humor that challenges perspectives\nAn intimate comedy club experience at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\n\nVenue Information\nBricktown Comedy Club Tulsa is Tulsa’s home for live stand-up comedy\, located at 5982 S Yale Ave. The intimate venue offers a full bar and dining menu\, creating the perfect atmosphere for a memorable night out. Every seat puts you close to the action. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Charleston White at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa start at $97 for General Admission and go up to $176 for Premium seating. Only 48 tickets remain — secure yours now! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/charleston-white-live-at-bricktown-comedy-club-tulsa/
LOCATION:Bricktown Comedy Club\, 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK\, 74135\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/comedy-WRvTmn.jpg
