SUMMARY:Kelly Collette LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nKelly Collette LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nDon’t miss Kelly Collette for one night only at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa! A standup comedian\, writer\, and storyteller\, Kelly has gained millions of views on social media with her hilarious\, relatable content. This is a rare chance to see her live in Tulsa. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM (Doors open 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Price: $22 \nAbout Kelly Collette\nKelly Collette is a standup comedian\, writer\, and storyteller who has built a massive social media following with her hilarious\, authentic content. Her clips have gained millions of views across platforms\, making her one of the most exciting rising voices in comedy. Known for her sharp wit\, relatable humor\, and engaging storytelling\, Kelly brings the same energy and authenticity to her live performances that has made her a fan favorite online. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up comedy from a viral social media sensation\nSharp wit and relatable storytelling\nAuthentic humor that connects with audiences of all backgrounds\nOne night only in Tulsa — a rare live performance opportunity\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at Loony Bin Tulsa\n\nVenue Information\nLoony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa at 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234 is Tulsa’s premier intimate comedy venue. With no seat more than 50 feet from the stage\, a full bar\, and a complete dining menu\, it’s the perfect setting for a memorable night of laughs. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Kelly Collette at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa are just $22. This is a one-night-only engagement — don’t miss out! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
