SUMMARY:Christian Johnson LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nChristian Johnson is a rising star in comedy with contagious good energy\, a unique style\, and refreshing clean comedy. He is best known for his viral comedy videos as “Uncle Nathaniel” — the character that took the internet by storm with his signature catchphrase “Lord Have Mer-Say.” \nChristian has gained over 2.5 million followers across his social media platforms and is rapidly making his way to the top of the list of comedians you need to know. He has shared the stage with countless celebrity comics and has traveled nationally and internationally sharing his undeniable talent. \nHis comedy is clean\, positive\, and universally relatable — the kind of humor that brings people together and leaves everyone in the room feeling good. Whether you know him from his viral videos or are discovering him for the first time\, Christian Johnson is a performer you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\nContent: Clean comedy\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full bar lounge where guests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable showroom with first-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are located center stage for the best views\, while General Admission tables are positioned on the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all checks in the showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nChristian Johnson brings the same infectious energy from his viral videos to the live stage — amplified and in person. His clean comedy style means this is a show you can enjoy with friends of all backgrounds\, and the laughs are genuine and plentiful throughout. \nExpect crowd interaction\, hilarious character work\, and the kind of positive\, uplifting comedy that reminds you why live stand-up is such a special experience. Christian’s connection with his audience is immediate and real. \nThis is a Sunday night show at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club — the perfect way to end your weekend on a high note. Grab your tickets now! \nTicket Information\n\nGeneral Admission: $25 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $35 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/christian-johnson-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/44_Edp-4G8w5S.png
GEO:29.5193054;-98.5060363
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club 618 Northwest Loop 410 San Antonio TX 78216 USA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=618 Northwest Loop 410:geo:-98.5060363,29.5193054
END:VEVENT
