SUMMARY:S.F. Comedy Showcase LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nS.F. Comedy Showcase LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club\nThe beloved S.F. Comedy Showcase returns to the iconic Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco for a night packed with top-tier stand-up comedy. Featuring a rotating lineup of local favorites and touring comedians\, this showcase is the perfect way to experience the best of Bay Area comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:45 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress: 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout S.F. Comedy Showcase\nThe S.F. Comedy Showcase is a long-running institution at Punch Line Comedy Club\, featuring a curated lineup of some of the best comedians performing in the Bay Area. Each show brings a fresh mix of emerging talent and established names\, making every performance unique and entertaining. \nWhat to Expect\n\nMultiple comedians performing back-to-back sets\nA mix of local Bay Area talent and touring comedians\nIntimate club atmosphere at one of SF’s most storied venues\nFull bar and beverage service available\n18+ show — valid photo ID required\nGeneral admission seating — first come\, first served\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the most iconic comedy clubs on the West Coast\, located at 444 Battery Street in the heart of San Francisco’s Financial District. The intimate setting ensures every seat has a great view of the stage. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $34. General Admission seating is first-come\, first-served. There is a 2 beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sf-comedy-showcase-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-2/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, California\, 94111\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/c8b/28f14b21-0890-485a-a04a-4bebb12b6c8b_1444221_RETINA_LANDSCAPE_16_9.jpg
GEO:37.795486;-122.4001359
