SUMMARY:Sunset Sundays Comedy Show at Upper Eastside Hangout
DESCRIPTION:Make the weekends last longer. Laugh during the Miami sunset with top comedians\, craft drinks\, food trucks\, and a neighborhood hangout vibe.\n\n\nA New Sunday Night Comedy Experience in Miami \nMiami Comedy is back on Sunday nights with the Biscuit Boyz comedy duo. \nJoin Miami’s Best Comedian\, Manny Garavito (as voted by Miami New Times)\, alongside Brian G\, one of the most booked and in-demand comedians in South Florida\, for a brand-new weekly comedy show at Upper East Side Hangout. \nManny and Brian have been working together for years and have a dynamic comedy style that includes crowdwork\, storytelling\, riffing\, and basically anything you throw at them. \nPerfect event for: \n\nBirthdays\nLocals looking for a neighborhood hang out spot\nVisitors looking to find where the locals hang out \nDate Night\nFamily Time\n…and anyone looking to make Sunday nights stand out during your weekend.\n\nLocated in one of Miami’s fastest-growing neighborhoods\, Upper East Side Hangout is exactly the kind of venue Miami needs more of. A laid-back outdoor gathering space.  \nFeaturing:\n\nCraft cocktails\nCold beers\nFood trucks\nPicnic tables \nHigh-top seating \n…and an atmosphere designed for people who actually want to enjoy where they’re spending their evening.\n\nSunset Sundays isn’t your typical comedy show experience. \nThis show was built for foodies\, friends\, families\, locals\, visitors\, and anyone looking for a better way to end the weekend.  \n \nFree Event For All \n \nVenue\nUpper East Side Hangout701 NE 79th StMiami\, FL 33138 \n \nFood Trucks:\n\nCheeseburger Baby\nNoodle Bar Hand Pulled Noodles\nProfessor Snacks Exotic Snacks\nTacomiendo Tacos
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sunset-sundays-comedy-show-at-upper-eastside-hangout-6/
LOCATION:Upper Eastside Hangout\, Northeast 79th Street 701\, Miami\, FL\, 33138\, United States
CATEGORIES:Showcase
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/567601418637ae2b03e8a8e7adefbff8-KutVBE.tmp_-TTqq4G.jpg
GEO:25.8480585;-80.1824101
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Upper Eastside Hangout Northeast 79th Street 701 Miami FL 33138 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=Northeast 79th Street 701:geo:-80.1824101,25.8480585
END:VEVENT
