SUMMARY:Ali Wong Live LIVE at McCaw Hall
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAli Wong is one of the biggest comedy stars in the world — an Emmy Award-winning actress\, comedian\, and writer whose Netflix specials Baby Cobra\, Hard Knock Wife\, and Don Wong have made her a household name. Known for her fearless\, hilarious\, and deeply personal comedy about marriage\, motherhood\, and modern life\, Wong has built a massive global following through her stand-up and screen work. \nHer breakout Netflix special Baby Cobra — filmed while she was seven months pregnant — became a cultural phenomenon and launched her into the comedy stratosphere. Since then\, Wong has starred in the Netflix series Beef (for which she won an Emmy)\, Always Be My Maybe\, and numerous other projects that have cemented her status as one of entertainment’s most versatile talents. \nAli Wong Live is her latest stand-up tour\, bringing a brand-new hour of comedy to some of the most prestigious venues in North America. Seattle’s McCaw Hall hosts two consecutive nights — August 12 and 13 — making this one of the most anticipated comedy events of the year in the Pacific Northwest. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, August 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: McCaw Hall\, 321 Mercer Street\, Seattle\, WA 98109\nAge Policy: All Ages\nSeating: Reserved Seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nMcCaw Hall is one of Seattle’s premier performance venues\, located at Seattle Center at 321 Mercer Street. Home to Seattle Opera and Pacific Northwest Ballet\, McCaw Hall is a world-class facility with stunning acoustics\, excellent sightlines\, and a capacity of approximately 2\,900 guests. \nThe venue features orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balcony seating levels\, offering excellent views from every section. McCaw Hall is conveniently located at Seattle Center\, steps from the Space Needle and easily accessible via the Seattle Center Monorail from downtown. \nParking is available at the Seattle Center Garage and numerous nearby lots. The venue is also accessible via Seattle Metro bus routes. \nWhat to Expect\nAli Wong Live is a must-see comedy event — a full evening of stand-up comedy from one of the funniest and most celebrated performers working today. Expect bold\, hilarious observations about life\, relationships\, and the human experience delivered with Wong’s signature fearless energy. \nWong’s live shows are known for their incredible energy and the sense that you’re witnessing something truly special. Her ability to connect with audiences through honest\, sometimes shocking humor creates an unforgettable shared experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Ali Wong Live at McCaw Hall are available now. Prices range from $65 to $150 depending on seat selection. \n\nOfficial Tickets: Purchase directly through Ticketmaster for guaranteed authentic tickets.\nResale Tickets: Find deals on resale tickets through VividSeats.\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ali-wong-live-at-mccaw-hall-seattle/
LOCATION:McCaw Hall\, 321 Mercer Street\, Seattle\, Washington\, 98109\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/253/e03b01e0-2f00-4b0e-be33-7c89a92f3253_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
