SUMMARY:Tony Dabas LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nTony Dabas\, hailing from Staten Island\, is a rising star in the New York City stand-up scene. Known for his quick wit and relatable humor\, Tony has also made a major name for himself in the world of social media\, collaborating with influencers on TikTok and Instagram to create hilarious characters and viral sketches. \nHis ability to connect with audiences both online and on stage makes him one of the most exciting comedians to watch in the comedy world right now. Tony’s comedy draws from his Staten Island roots and New York City experiences\, delivering the kind of sharp\, street-smart humor that resonates with audiences everywhere. \nWith a rapidly growing fanbase and a natural talent for both stand-up and character work\, Tony Dabas is building a career that is only going to get bigger. Don’t miss your chance to see him live in San Antonio! \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, August 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\nVIP Meet & Greet: Available with VIP ticket purchase\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full bar lounge where guests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable showroom with first-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are located center stage for the best views\, while General Admission tables are positioned on the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all checks in the showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Dabas brings the energy of New York City comedy to the San Antonio stage. His stand-up is fast-paced\, relatable\, and packed with the kind of sharp observations that make you laugh because they’re so true. \nVIP ticket holders get the added bonus of a Meet & Greet with Tony before the show — a great opportunity to meet one of comedy’s hottest rising stars up close. VIP seating is located center stage for the best view in the house. \nThis is a Wednesday night show at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club — the perfect mid-week pick-me-up. Grab your tickets now! \nTicket Information\n\nGeneral Admission: $25 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $35 (+ fees)\nVIP w/ Meet & Greet: $45 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
