SUMMARY:Matt Fulchiron LIVE at Milwaukee Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nMatt Fulchiron LIVE at Milwaukee Improv\nGet ready for a hilarious night of stand-up comedy as Matt Fulchiron takes the stage at Milwaukee Improv in Brookfield\, Wisconsin. Known for his sharp wit and relatable storytelling\, Fulchiron delivers a high-energy performance that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Milwaukee Improv (Main Room)\nAddress: 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfield\, WI 53045\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nSeating: General admission\, first-come first-served (except groups and premium booths)\nTwo-Item Minimum: Required per person in the showroom \nAbout Matt Fulchiron\nMatt Fulchiron is a stand-up comedian known for his clever observations and energetic stage presence. He has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, building a loyal fanbase with his authentic and hilarious material. His comedy blends everyday life experiences with sharp comedic timing that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy with Matt Fulchiron headlining\nSharp\, witty material covering everyday life and relatable topics\nIntimate club setting at Milwaukee Improv’s Main Room\nTwo-item minimum purchase per person (food and drinks available)\n21+ event — bring valid photo ID\nNo photography or video recording during the performance\n\nVenue Information\nMilwaukee Improv (Main Room) is located at 20110 Lower Union Street in Brookfield\, Wisconsin\, just outside Milwaukee. The venue offers an intimate comedy club atmosphere with excellent sightlines and a full food and drink menu to enjoy during the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available starting at $26.22\, with premium options up to $80.58. Secure your seats now through official Ticketmaster or resale options via VividSeats. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
